flowchart TD
 A[Identify consultant and project] --> B[Prefill authorized context]
 B --> C[MiChat voice or text interview]
 C --> D[Adaptive follow-up and challenge]
 D --> E[Project and individual contribution evidence]
 E --> F[Attach artifacts, metrics, sources and attribution]
 F --> G[Manager or project owner factual review]
 G --> H{Accepted?}
 H -- No --> I[Clarify, correct or dispute] --> C
 H -- Yes --> J[Approve evidence revision]
 J --> K[Purpose-specific projections]
 K --> L[DNA skills update]
 K --> M[MeChat CV]
 K --> N[IMP capability signal]
 J --> O[MAAP Review when due or triggered]
 J --> P[Spotlight story candidate]
 P --> Q[Fact, customer, confidentiality and publication approvals]
 Q --> R{Public release authorized?}
 R -- No --> S[Hold, revise or internal-only]
 R -- Yes --> T[Publish approved Spotlight version]
